<p>Fire a relatively low-powered shot at a foe doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">94%, 113%, 127%, 139%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage, if it hits a cone-shaped shockwave of radius 4 emanates from the impact, stunning it and all creatures caught inside for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p>